OFFICIAL-SENSITIVE

Cumbria Local Resilience Forum - Storm Fenella response - SITREP 13
Time of report: 17/01/2026 1700

1. SITUATION
Incident status: RECOVERY
Properties flooded: approx. 340 (unconfirmed).

2. SITES AND ROUTES
- Riverside CC: stood down
- Northside Bridge, Workington: closed to all traffic
- A591 Keswick to Grasmere: reopened
- Pooley Bridge crossing: reopened after inspection
- Cockermouth School: closed, all residents rehoused (run by Cumberland Council)
- Glenridding Village Hall: rest centre closed
- Fellside: back in use (run by Fellside Care Ltd)

3. AGENCIES RESPONDING
North Cumbria Integrated Care NHS Foundation Trust, EA, North West Ambulance Service, Westmorland and Furness Council, Birtish Red Cross, Cumbria Constabulary

4. NEXT MEETING
SCG at 1000. Dial-in details as previously circulated.

